{{Skill infobox|id=AspectOfTheSpider}}

'''Aspect of the Spider''' is an [[aspect]] skill that applies a stack of {{stl|Spider's Web}} on nearby enemies every second, increasing the damage they take by 5% per stack, and inflicts {{stl|Hinder}}. Only one aspect skill can be active at a time.

Aspect of the Spider is found on {{il|Fenumus' Weave}} or [[beastcrafted]] onto gear as a [[Item affix|suffix]] with the "{{c|unique|[[Fenumus, First of the Night]]}}" [[Beastcrafting#List of beast recipes|beastcraft recipe]]. The skill can be further modified by equipping {{il|Fenumus' Toxins}}, {{il|Fenumus' Shroud}} and {{il|Fenumus' Spinnerets}}. The Level 30 version of the skill is acquired from beastcrafting with the addition of [[The Black Mórrígan]].

__TOC__

==Mechanics==
Aspect of the Spider can be linked to support gems like {{il|More Duration Support}} or {{il|Increased Area of Effect Support}} to modify the Aspect's effects. Notably, Aspect of the Spider can also be linked to {{il|Inspiration Support}}, increasing its reservation, but will not cause any (useful) changes to the skill.

{{il|Fenumus' Spinnerets}} increases the maximum number of Spider's Web stacks by 1.

